1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,733
Tuesday. 10:58 PM. Mile marker two-
fourteen, and nothing else for forty
miles.

2
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:09,167
Eleven bucks an hour. Cash. Starts
tonight.

3
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:12,233
Listen close. I'm only saying this
once.

4
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:15,667
Under the register there's a notebook.
Do what it says.

5
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:19,067
Even when it sounds stupid. Especially
then.

6
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:21,633
Why? What happened to the last guy?

7
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:24,733
He quit. Sleep in the day. See you in
a week.

8
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:29,133
The line goes dead. The lights hum.
The clock says 11:00.

9
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:33,333
The notebook has thirteen rules.
Twelve of them keep you alive.

10
00:00:34,033 --> 00:00:37,833
The last one is different. It's the
only way anyone ever leaves this job.

11
00:00:38,533 --> 00:00:42,533
I'll tell you what it says at the very
end. Don't skip. You'll need it.
